    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποικονομ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>manage so as to get rid of</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.6.1
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶν πάθος καὶ νόσημα τῆς
				ἑαυτοῦ ψυχῆς</span>
			<i>get rid of</i> them <i>by one's manner of life,</i>
				Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.51A.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				1.4.6
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5.9.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.497
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be removed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.37.17
			</span></i>.</div>
